---
source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
  x unknown node `version` in a local library
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:11:13]
 10 |             source "../components"
 11 |             version "v1.0.0"
    :             ^^^|^^^
    :                `-- not part of the schema
 12 |         }
    `----
  help: a local library accepts `source`; a library read at a version goes in
        `remote`

  x this library declares no `source`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:22:9]
 21 |         unfetched { source "../components" }
 22 |         nowhere
    :         ^^^|^^^
    :            `-- a remote library needs one
 23 |     }
    `----
  help: `source "https://github.com/owner/library"`, or a path to a Git
        checkout

  x unknown node `stray` in libraries
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:24:5]
 23 |     }
 24 |     stray { source "../components" }
    :     ^^|^^
    :       `-- not part of the schema
 25 | }
    `----
  help: a library goes in `local` or `remote`: `remote { stable { source
