  x `Scratch` is not a library name
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:8:9]
 7 |         buildc-org { source "../components" }
 8 |         Scratch { source "../components" }
   :         ^^^|^^^
   :            `-- lowercase, digits and dashes, starting with a letter
 9 |         pinned {
   `----
  help: a tree node's `library=` names the library by it

  x `hosted` is a local library
