  help: one name is one library; merge the fields or rename one declaration

  x `insecure` does not use an HTTPS Git URL
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:20:20]
 19 |         }
 20 |         insecure { source "http://github.com/buildc-org/modules" }
    :                    ^^^|^^
    :                       `-- not HTTPS
 21 |         unfetched { source "../components" }
    `----
  help: `source "https://host/owner/repository"`; credentials and host policy
        stay with Git

  x `../outside` is not a folder inside the repository
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:27:11]
 26 | 
 27 | library { components "../outside" }
    :           ^^^^^|^^^^
    :                `-- outside the repository
 28 | 
    `----
  help: name a relative path that stays inside the repository; `.` and `..`
        segments are resolved, and `..` never rises above the repository root

  x remote library `unfetched`: tests/repos/broken-sources/../components is
  | not a Git checkout
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-sources/repo.kdl:21:9]
 20 |         insecure { source "http://github.com/buildc-org/modules" }
 21 |         unfetched { source "../components" }
    :         ^^^^|^^^^
    :             `-- not a Git checkout
 22 |         nowhere
    `----
  help: a remote path names an existing Git checkout. buildc reads it at a
        commit; correct `source`, or move `unfetched` under `local` if the
        folder is inside this repository

